  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 37
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Around you, the werewolves begin to change. Bones crack and reshape,
    skin ripples as fur bursts through, faces elongate into muzzles. The elegant
    ballroom fills with snarls and howls.
